 to deliver both <strong data-start=\"262\" data-end=\"271\">power</strong> and <strong data-start=\"276\" data-end=\"284\">data</strong> over a single Ethernet cable. Ideal for <strong data-start=\"325\" data-end=\"339\">IP cameras</strong>, <strong data-start=\"341\" data-end=\"367\">wireless access points</strong>, <strong data-start=\"369\" data-end=\"384\">VoIP phones</strong>, and other <strong data-start=\"396\" data-end=\"419\">PoE-enabled devices</strong>, this compact, easy-to-install device reduces cable clutter and simplifies setup.</p>\n<p data-start=\"503\" data-end=\"522\" class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"505\" data-end=\"521\">Key Features</strong>:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"523\" data-end=\"993\"><li data-start=\"523\" data-end=\"628\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"525\" data-end=\"628\" class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"525\" data-end=\"558\">IEEE 802.3af/at Compatibility</strong>: Supports <strong data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"576\">PoE</strong> (Power over Ethernet) for efficient power delivery.</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"692\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"631\" data-end=\"692\" class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"631\" data-end=\"653\">Wide Voltage Input</strong>: 100-240V AC for global compatibility.</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"693\" data-end=\"800\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"800\" class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"721\">Versatile Output Power</strong>: Available in 15.4W (PoE) and 30W (PoE+) options to meet various device needs.</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"889\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"803\" data-end=\"889\" class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"803\" data-end=\"831\">Plug &amp; Play Installation</strong>: Simple, no-software-required setup for quick deployment.</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"993\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"993\" class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"915\">Enhanced Protection</strong>: Over-voltage, over-current, and short-circuit protection for safe operation.</p>\n</li></ul>\n<p data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1215\" class=\"\">Perfect for <strong data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1024\">home networks</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1026\" data-end=\"1043\">office setups</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1073\">surveillance systems</strong>, our <strong data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1103\">PoE Injector/Adapter</strong> is the reliable, cost-effective solution to power your network devices without the hassle of additional cables.</p>","detailsHtml":"<p>PoE Injector/Adapter</p>","topDesc":"","subcats":[],"products":[{"id":"299","name":"PoE Spilter 1-To-2 Saving Cable Three-way RJ45 Connector","href":"/accessories/poe-injector-adapter/poe-spilter-1-to-2-saving-cable-three-way-rj45-connector","image":{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/PoE%20Spilter/PoE-Spilter-250x250.jpg.webp","width":250,"height":250},"imageSecond":{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/PoE%20Spilter/Untitled-1-250x250.jpg.webp","width":250,"height":250},"price":"380৳","oldPrice":null,"label":null,"requestPrice":false,"brand":null,"model":"PoE Spilter 1-To-2","features":[]},{"id":"300","name":"POE Splitter PD18G 48V to 12V","href":"/accessories/poe-injector-adapter/poe-splitter-pd18g-48v-to-12v","image":{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/China%20Good%20Quality/POE%20Splitter/POE-Splitter-P1-250x250.jpg.webp","width":250,"height":250},"imageSecond":{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/China%20Good%20Quality/POE%20Splitter/POE-Splitter-P2-250x250.jpg.webp","width":250,"height":250},"price":"380৳","oldPrice":null,"label":null,"requestPrice":false,"brand":{"name":"China","href":"/index.php?route=product/manufacturer/info&manufacturer_id=75"},"model":"PD18G","features":["Model: PD18G 48V to 12V","RJ45 female input","RJ45 male and male DC jack 5.5 x 2.1mm output","10 / 100Mbps data transfer rate","205mm wire length","Plug and play and 82 x 28 x 23.5mm size"]},{"id":"664","name":"Wi-Tek WI-POE11S-48V PoE Splitter 1x 100 Mbps PoE input with 802.3 a